# Example 01 — single-shot DLIB:BFGS baseline.
#
# What this exercises:
#   - TYPE PLAIN: single-shot dispatch, no decorators.
#   - DLIB:BFGS as a local refinement engine.
#   - The default (no INIT block) — iter 0 is the implicit CONFIG point.

OPTIMIZER
  STRATEGY
    TYPE PLAIN
    LIB DLIB
    ALGO BFGS
    MAXEVAL 6
  ENDSTRATEGY
ENDOPTIMIZER

LOSS L2
FAILSCORE 1e16
PC_ERMSE 0 0.0001
PC_LAMMPS --script ../common/lammps/Ecoh.in --varloss Ecoh 8.10 800

OPTIM RCUT2B (1) 4.0 6.0

OUTPUT 1
BOUTPUT 1
